{"id":"word:hebrew:H899","type":"word","title":"בֶּגֶד","subtitle":"H899 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a covering , i.e. clothing ; also treachery or pillage","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to בֶּגֶד (H899) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 218 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"בֶּגֶד (beged) means a covering , i.e. clothing ; also treachery or pillage First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 1 1."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"בֶּגֶד","transliteration":"beged","pronunciation":"behg'-ed","strong":"H899","lemmaId":"hebrew:H899","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["בִּגְדֵ֥י","בְּגָדָ֔י/ו","בְּגָדָ֛י/ו","בְּגָדָ֖י/ו","בִּגְדֵ֣י"],"morphs":[["HNcmpc/Sp3ms",51],["HNcmpc",35],["HNcmpa",23],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",11],["HRd/Ncmsa",9],["HNcmsc",9],["HNcmpc/Sp2ms",8],["HNcmsa",8],["HTd/Ncmpa",7],["HNcmpc/Sp3mp",7]]},"definitions":{"short":"a covering , i.e. clothing ; also treachery or pillage","usage":"apparel, cloth(-es, ing), garment, lap, rag, raiment, robe, × very (treacherously), vesture, wardrobe.","full":"H899. beged I. בֶּ֫גֶד noun [masculine] treachery , Isa 24:16 ; Jer 12:1 . II. בֶּ֫גֶד noun masculine (except Lev 6:20 עָלֶיהָ , but Samaritan עליו , compare Di in loco Kö i. 182 ) garment, covering — Gen 28:2 36t.; suffix בִּגְדוֺ Ezek 9:3 + (14 t. without dag. lene Ges Lgb. 94 ); plural בְּגָדִים Lev 6:4 32t.; construct בִּגְדֵי Gen 27:15 39 t.; suffix בְּגָדֶיךָ 1Kin 22:20 81t.; בִּגְדֹתֶיךָ Psa 45:9 ; &#8212; 1 garment, clothing, raiment, robe of any kind, from the filthy clothing of the leper to the holy robes of the high priest, the simplest covering of the poor as well as the costly raiment of the rich and noble, used throughout Hebrew Literature: Gen 24:53 (J), 28:20 (E; 14 t. J E), Exod 28:2 + (P 90 t.), Deut 24:17 ; Judg 8:26 4 t., 1Sam 19:13 10 t., 1Kin 1:1 23 t., 2Chr 18:9 + (Chronicles 9 t.), Est 4:1 , 4 ; Job 13:28 ; 22:6 ; 37:17 ; Psa 22:19 ; 45:9 ; 102:27 ; 109:19 ; Prov 6:27 ; 20:16 ; 25:20 ; 27:13 ; Eccl 9:8 ; Isa 2 Isa 24:16 ; 36:22 ; 37:1 ; Isa 3 50:9-10 t.; Jer 12:1 3 t., Ezek 16:16 13 t.; Joel 2:13 ; Amos 2:8 ; Hag 2:12 ; Zech 3:3-4 , 5 ; 14:14 ; בִגְדוֺ מְלֹא his lapful 2Kin 4:39 . 2 covering, wrapping , of furniture of tabernacle Num 4:6-13 (6 t.); coverlet of a bed 1Sam 19:13 .","rootNote":"from 898 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 1 1","keyReferences":["1Kgs 1 1","1Kgs 21 27","1Kgs 22 10","1Kgs 22 30","1Sam 19 13","1Sam 19 24","1Sam 27 9","1Sam 28 8"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":218,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 1 1","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/בְּגָדִ֔ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 21 27","book":"1Kgs","chapter":21,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּגָדָ֔י/ו","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 22 10","book":"1Kgs","chapter":22,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּגָדִים֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 22 30","book":"1Kgs","chapter":22,"verse":30,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּגָדֶ֑י/ךָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 19 13","book":"1Sam","chapter":19,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/בָּֽגֶד","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 19 24","book":"1Sam","chapter":19,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּגָדָ֗י/ו","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 27 9","book":"1Sam","chapter":27,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/בְגָדִ֔ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Sam 28 8","book":"1Sam","chapter":28,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּגָדִ֣ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpa"},{"reference":"2Chr 18 9","book":"2Chr","chapter":18,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceW